# Cross-origin isolation lets "Find by meaning" use threads when it runs the model in WebAssembly
# (browsers only allow SharedArrayBuffer on isolated pages). "credentialless" keeps cross-origin
# images in the data and Cloudflare's analytics script loading, without credentials.
# Cloudflare serves these headers; GitHub Pages ignores this file (there the fallback is single-threaded).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
